    "body": "﻿Addressed: merged current main (no rebase, no force-push), touched suites green:\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --lib`: 600 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --test multiaxis`: 7 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-motion --test rotary`: 11 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test operations`: 124 passed, 0 failed (6 ignored)\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test rotary_stated_axis`: 10 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test rotary_verify`: 9 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test center_cut_multiaxis`: 6 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test continuous_4axis_part`: 10 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\nNotes: the merge brought main's `stated_axis` field into the `OpParams` variants main's own tests construct; two main-side test initializers (`rotary_verify.rs`, `rotary_parallel_keyway.rs`) needed `stated_axis: None`. The example golden `examples/first-continuous-4axis-part.nc` regenerated with `WRITE_GOLDEN=1` matched main's copy; the example project re-saved identically.\nMarked ready per the request.\r\n",
